<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Apr producer/import prices down 0.9 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Swiss Apr producer/import prices down 0.9 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The combined index for Swiss producer and import prices rose 0.1 percent in April to stand 0.9 percent lower than a year earlier, the Federal Statistics Office said.  </p>
<p>				    Apr 1997   Mar 1997   Apr 1996</p>
<p>Monthly pct index change     +0.1	  +0.2	 +0.1</p>
<p>Yr/yr pct index change	 -0.9	  -0.8	 -1.9</p>
<p>Index (100 = May 1993)	 97.2	  97.0	 98.0</p>
<p>Note - The combined producer/import price index replaced the wholesale price index in May 1993.  </p>
<p>The office also detailed the producer price index:</p>
<p>				    Apr 1997   Mar 1997   Apr 1996</p>
<p> Monthly pct index change     -0.2	 +0.2	 +0.1</p>
<p> Yr/yr pct index change	 -1.4	 -1.1	 -1.5</p>
<p> Index (100 = May 1993)	 96.8	 97.0	 98.1</p>
<p>Import price index:</p>
<p>				    Apr 1997   Mar 1997   Apr 1996</p>
<p> Monthly pct index change    +1.0	  +0.3	 +0.2</p>
<p> Yr/yr pct index change	+0.5	  -0.3	 -3.0</p>
<p> Index (100 = May 1993)	98.1	  97.2	 97.7</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
